From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bpereira <bpereira@cloudflare.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 04:52:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Break lines from a summary of a layout's break segments

An embedder that evicts a laid-out paragraph needs to break and measure
it again without reshaping. Summarize a layout's break segments (widths,
break opportunities, inline boxes, indent) so lines can be broken from
the summary, including pre-wrap text, top and bottom aligned spans and
paragraphs with absolutely positioned boxes, and expose the text indent
a layout was last given. Breaking from a summary yields the same lines
as breaking the shaped layout.

Signed-off-by: bpereira <bpereira@cloudflare.com>
